["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Next Era of Games: Mods, Agents, and Infinite Worlds modding decompilation 3.js\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-a16z-ai-让做游戏从十年压到两年-烂genre要迎来文艺复兴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓做遊戲從十年壓到兩年，爛genre要迎來文藝復興</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GTA6 開發花了十二年，a16z 兩位合夥人認為 AI 工具已經能把遊戲原型週期壓縮到數週，這會讓工作室敢在冷門類型和新 IP 上下注，而不是只敢做續作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">遊戲開發</span><span class=\"tag\">AI工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Powering AI-Driven Drug Discovery with President of Isomorphic Labs Max Jaderberg AlphaFold organoids / organs on a chip CRO (contract research organization)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-nopriors-药物研发卡住的根源不是审批太严-而是临床前看不见毒性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/75fbbd0fbc432e9e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">39:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>藥物研發卡住的根源不是審批太嚴，而是臨床前看不見毒性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Isomorphic Labs 的判斷是：藥物成本飆升主要來自臨床階段的失敗，而失敗根源在於臨床前根本看不到毒性——大鼠毒性測試對人類的預測力只有約三成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI製藥</span><span class=\"tag\">藥物研發</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Can Network Science Transform Health and Nutrition? preferential attachment scale-free network disease module foodome dark matter of nutrition\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-thejoyofwhy-食物里还藏着13-5万种-暗物质-分子-科学还不知道它们在做什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1991479e40b3c047-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Joy of Why</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>食物裡還藏著13.5萬種「暗物質」分子，科學還不知道它們在做什麼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">網絡科學家發現，食物中除了約150種已知營養成分外，還有13.5萬種從未被歸類的分子——它們不提供能量，卻像成千上萬種藥物一樣在細胞裡做微調控。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡科學</span><span class=\"tag\">無標度網絡</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Winners and Losers of Index Investing (Martin Schmalz) | #435 common ownership horizon-dependent risk aversion tragedy of the commons volatility laundering\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-rationalreminder-指数基金对每个人都理性-模型里却可能让所有人集体变穷/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>指數基金對每個人都理性，模型裡卻可能讓所有人集體變窮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當分散投資變得夠便宜，資金從個股和債券湧入股市，推高股價、壓低預期回報——每個人都做了對自己最優的選擇，結果卻可能是所有人一起變差，這是一場公地悲劇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指數投資</span><span class=\"tag\">反壟斷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Origins of the Affordable Care Act Medicare for all single-payer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-throughline-肯尼迪晚年最大遗憾-1974年差点和尼克松谈成全民医保/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">28:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>肯尼迪晚年最大遺憾：1974年差點和尼克松談成全民醫保</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">尼克松在水門事件最絕望時提出的醫改方案，比後來的奧巴馬醫保更激進，肯尼迪卻因盟友壓力放棄談判，事後稱這是他政治生涯最大的遺憾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療保險</span><span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Robots on Fire: The Army’s $500 Million Factory Fiasco undefinitized contracting action flow forming\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-papertrail-5亿美元炮弹新厂两年颗粒无收-军方却从不索回一分钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42070ee0db99b191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">34:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>5億美元炮彈新廠兩年顆粒無收，軍方卻從不索回一分錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">General Dynamics 從土耳其引進的新設備兩年沒造出一發合格炮彈，軍隊停了兩條產線後仍照常支付進度款，既不索賠也不終止合同，反而繼續給這家公司新合同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防採購</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Liquidating a whale by hand, 22 times margin call DeFi lending protocol wrapped token\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-complexsys-手动清算一个巨鲸的仓位22次-杠杆率只是四年级除法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/869854f30ccd1804-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">22:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>手動清算一個巨鯨的倉位22次：槓桿率只是四年級除法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FTX崩盤期間，Solend上一個巨鯨賬戶資不抵債，程序沒能自動清算，作者靠手動點按鈕22次完成了清算機器人該做的事，順帶賺了約50%收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">槓桿</span><span class=\"tag\">DeFi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Nvidia&#x27;s Megaspeed Scandal Is Really All About NVIDIA Cloud Partner (NCP) AI diffusion rule remote access zero-day inferencing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-oddlots-nvidia对华芯片管控的最大漏洞-不卖芯片-租给你用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>NVIDIA對華芯片管控的最大漏洞：不賣芯片，租給你用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Megaspeed用46億美元買進NVIDIA芯片轉租阿里巴巴，遠程訪問不違法；NVIDIA核查後仍有5萬塊芯片下落不明，部分是最先進的Blackwell。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">NVIDIA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV Special: Measles Mini Symposium EMT (epithelial-mesenchymal transition) cGAS live cell extrusion air-liquid interface culture\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-twiv-麻疹病毒三十年不变异-多突变同时发生在数学上不可能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>麻疹病毒三十年不變異：多突變同時發生在數學上不可能</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">麻疹是RNA病毒卻幾乎不變異，因為逃逸疫苗需要F蛋白和H蛋白同時發生多個突變，這在概率上幾乎不可能實現，這也是同一支疫苗能用幾十年的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗接種率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Plain of Jars: An Ancient Asian Mystery secondary burial MNI (minimum number of individuals) tooth ablation Secret War\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-ancients-老挝石缸之谜-石器摆在那-人骨却是公元1000年的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccb88a1d887baf32-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>老撾石缸之謎：石器擺在那，人骨卻是公元1000年的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">石缸本身無法直接測年，但缸內外反覆出現的人骨、牙齒拔除和1000年前後的年代，說明這套石缸喪葬傳統可能一直延續到鐵器時代之後很久。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">東南亞考古</span><span class=\"tag\">喪葬習俗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How Rasputin Destroyed the Romanovs with Anthony Beevor Stavka\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-historyhit-拉斯普京唯一正确的建议-沙皇偏偏没听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bc43533ed0928f37-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">45:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>拉斯普京唯一正確的建議，沙皇偏偏沒聽</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拉斯普京勸沙皇不要參戰，這是他少數正確的建議，但沙皇恰恰在軍事問題上從不聽他的，卻在人事任命上對他和皇后言聽計從，最終拖垮整個帝國的行政體系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄國革命</span><span class=\"tag\">羅曼諾夫王朝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"412. Lawrence of Arabia: Guerrilla Warfare In The Arab Revolt (Part 2) Sykes-Picot Treaty Balfour Declaration Hejaz Railway Arab Bureau Seven Pillars of Wisdom\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-empirehist-劳伦斯真正背叛的不是阿拉伯人-而是自己效忠的大英帝国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">43:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>勞倫斯真正背叛的不是阿拉伯人，而是自己效忠的大英帝國</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國情報官勞倫斯提前獲悉英法瓜分阿拉伯世界的密約後，沒有效忠大英帝國，而是告訴費薩爾「不要相信我政府的承諾」，自己先選了邊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿拉伯起義</span><span class=\"tag\">勞倫斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"722. The Charge of the Light Brigade: The Tsar’s Terrible Siege (Part 2) Minié rifle sawback reconnaissance\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-restishistory-俄军已主动撤围-英法却现编了一个入侵克里米亚的理由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d69379084116b18-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>俄軍已主動撤圍，英法卻現編了一個入侵克里米亞的理由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">圍攻西利斯特里亞解除後，英法在巴爾幹的戰爭目標其實已經達成，入侵克里米亞、圍攻塞瓦斯托波爾只是為了給已經出征的艦隊和不滿的輿論一個交代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亞戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">英國軍事史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Is it intent or impact that matters in our relationships? (with Shwani Turner) locus of control light gassing PDA (pathological demand avoidance) declarative language decoupling\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-clearerthink-责任不在意图也不在影响-而在于伤害是否可预见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>責任不在意圖也不在影響，而在於傷害是否可預見</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沖人大吼侮辱該自己負責；一句無害的稱讚讓對方崩潰，那更多是聽者自己過去的經歷在起作用，不該全算說話人的賬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人際關係</span><span class=\"tag\">自我責任</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"$20M Run Rate, Zero Co-Founders | Ben Cera, Polsia true solo free solo juiced solo\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-solofounders-零联合创始人-一人公司把年化收入做到2000万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/347f00c2fdab662f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>零聯合創始人，一人公司把年化收入做到2000萬美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">靠的不是秘密武器，而是他直接跳過了「找聯合創始人」這一步——他認為多數聯合創始人只是創始人圖安心找的保險，真到決策時反而互相拖後腿。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.281 小歷史 | 1998，寶馬和大眾瓜分勞斯萊斯 first and final bid\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-bizthisway-大众花4-3亿英镑买下劳斯莱斯-却买不到这个名字/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">41:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商業就是這樣</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>大眾花4.3億英鎊買下勞斯萊斯，卻買不到這個名字</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">勞斯萊斯的商標權自1971年拆分起就不歸造車的公司所有，大眾砸下4.3億英鎊買下工廠與賓利，卻買不到勞斯萊斯這個名字，最終只能讓給寶馬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">併購</span><span class=\"tag\">品牌授權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Mapping Humanity From Space: NASA’s Black Marble with Dr. Miguel Román Black Marble Golden Goose Award VIIRS nadir downscaling\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-fromfirstprinc-被当成仪器故障的数据异常-竟是开罗城在斋月里的灯光变化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59727fbf3d73d196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">48:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>被當成儀器故障的數據異常，竟是開羅城在齋月裡的燈光變化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">團隊原以為是儀器故障，耗費數年排查後才發現，開羅、安曼等城市的夜間亮度是按伊斯蘭曆而非公曆波動的，異常曲線精確對上了齋月的開齋節。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">衛星遙感</span><span class=\"tag\">夜間燈光數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"#889: Q&amp;A with Tim — How to Get Unstuck, Resilience in Hard Times, Tools for Brain Health, Finding Inner Peace, Optimism as a Learnable Skill, and More IFS (Internal Family Systems) fear setting hemoglobin A1c Zone 2 training\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-timferriss-行动的风险被高估了-不行动的代价才被低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>行動的風險被高估了，不行動的代價才被低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">寫下一年、三年、十年不改變會發生什麼，那幅畫面通常比你想像中更可怕——這比盤算風險更能推動你做出真正的改變。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為改變</span><span class=\"tag\">阿爾茨海默病預防</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Too dry for cacti: extreme droughts could push iconic species to extinction severe drought model CAD obesity (combined anthropometric definition of obesity) IUCN Red List\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-naturepod-仙人掌没你想得那么耐旱-极端干旱下四分之一物种会丢掉八成栖息地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">24:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>仙人掌沒你想得那麼耐旱：極端乾旱下四分之一物種會丟掉八成棲息地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">仙人掌被當作抗旱標杆，但研究者把極端乾旱納入氣候模型後發現，近四分之一物種將損失超過八成適宜棲息地，遠超常規氣候模型的預測。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候變化</span><span class=\"tag\">生物多樣性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"A New Vision for Human Work After Automation GDPval agency rupture allocation economy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-aiandi-ai-让生成答案变得廉价-稀缺的是你带着视角去追问/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c79a115d7e2b3b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">26:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓生成答案變得廉價，稀缺的是你帶著視角去追問</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當所有人都能從 Claude 拿到同樣的默認答案，真正值錢的不是模型能力本身，而是你因為責任和視角而去追問出的那個不一樣的答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 自動化</span><span class=\"tag\">未來工作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Credit Cards EMV chip Charga-Plate coverture usury law Fresno Drop\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-stuffmissed-美国银行1958年给整座城市邮寄6万张信用卡-不用申请/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>美國銀行1958年給整座城市郵寄6萬張信用卡，不用申請</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1958年美國銀行給弗雷斯諾6萬居民直接寄去信用卡，不問資質、沒有申請——這場豪賭幾乎讓銀行賠到破產，卻意外開啟了全國性信用卡時代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用卡</span><span class=\"tag\">消費金融</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Agents That Think Together: Cisco&#x27;s Vijoy Pandey on Semantic Alignment, Scope, Accord &amp; Concord Internet of Cognition Scope Accord / Concord GATs / COGs neuralese / latent space communication\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-cogrev-多智能体系统仪表盘全绿-但任务完成率为零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0ad67f662e5c86c3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>多智能體系統儀表盤全綠，但任務完成率為零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cisco發現一個多智能體系統在儀表盤上顯示66%在線、運行正常，實際任務完成率卻是0%——因為現有監控只檢查連接狀態，不檢查語義是否對齊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能體系統</span><span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the Internet Boom Teaches Us About the AI Buildout | Mike Volpi WDM stat-muxing neocloud KV cache model router\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-a16z-ai算力终将被用尽-但资产的主人很可能会换人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>AI算力終將被用盡，但資產的主人很可能會換人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">上一輪光纖泡沫裡，負債最重的公司率先破產，但光纖資產被別人接手後照樣好用；Mike Volpi 認為這輪 GPU 建設會重演同一劇本——資產會被充分利用，歸屬權卻很可能換人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力週期</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU資產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.135律政佳人轉行賣饅頭 年入4億 聊聊早餐創新的秘密 PB\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-nengzheduolao-水饺有巨头-包子馒头没有-因为机器学不会捏褶子的手感/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08bfa83c9f3d2123-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"能\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">能者多嘮｜商業原聲</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>水餃有巨頭，包子饅頭沒有，因為機器學不會捏褶子的手感</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">水餃湯圓早被思念三全這樣的巨頭規模化吃下，包子饅頭卻因為發麵要靠手工捏褶，機械做不出那種蓬鬆感，十年來始終留給小品牌生存空間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品消費</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈</span>\n</div></div></a>"]